       the new angle straight away. Otherwise the slider appears to do nothing
       until the next Place, which is exactly what "the arm always turns to the
       same position" looked like. Never move it mid-swing or after a test. */
    if (state.animPhase === 'idle' && state.placed && !state.fractured) {
      state.pendulumAngle = -state.releaseAngle;
